  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dad is in the garden today. Lily and Pip are with him. \"What can I do?\" asks Lily. \"You can water the flowers,\" says Dad. Lily waters the red flowers. Pip runs in the garden. Squeaky looks at Lily. \"Hello, Squeaky!\" says Lily. Squeaky is small and brown. He looks at the flowers.",
      "Then the rain comes. It is a lot of rain! \"Run, run!\" says Dad. Dad, Lily, and Pip run to the house. They stand at the door. Lily looks at the garden. \"Where is Squeaky?\" she asks. \"His home is wet,\" says Lily. \"He is not happy.\"",
      "Lily gets a big box. She runs to his home. She puts the box on his home. Now the home is not wet. Squeaky smiles. He is happy now. \"You can sleep here,\" says Lily. She writes a name on the box. It says, \"Squeaky's House.\" Pip says, \"Woof!\" Dad smiles at Lily."
    ],
